WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.730
What can you read from a curve without any numbers?

00:00:03.730 --> 00:00:06.210
Where it crosses the axes.

00:00:06.210 --> 00:00:08.150
Where it turns.

00:00:08.150 --> 00:00:10.620
Where it rises and falls.

00:00:10.620 --> 00:00:14.016
These features tell the story of the graph.
